# Edge Worker Fleet — 8 Workers, Infinite Scale, Zero Threshold

## Architecture

Cloudflare Workers auto-scale globally. Each worker script handles a distinct concern. Adding workers costs $0 per invocation on the Workers Paid plan. The fleet is designed so no single worker is a bottleneck — each can scale independently from 0 to 10M+ requests/hour.

